<p>I want this draft to read a bit mysterious, but ultimately melancholic.</p>
<p>Its an SCP about a town abandoned for 70ish years and incredibly lonely. The dialogue needs to read well, and I want it to be put together how the solution is reached re: containment but I have not directly spelled it out.</p>
<p>Thanks in advance! (About 3000 words)</p>
<p>Draft: <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/grigori-karpin-ii">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/grigori-karpin-ii</a></p>

